WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.211
SERSI
We're Eternals.

00:00:02.547 --> 00:00:04.838
We came here to protect
humans from the Deviants.

00:00:05.820 --> 00:00:07.320
THENA
When you love something,

00:00:07.766 --> 00:00:08.800
you fight for it.

00:00:09.758 --> 00:00:11.668
JACK
Dad, I saw him on TV with a cape

00:00:11.719 --> 00:00:12.851
shooting laser beams!

00:00:14.253 --> 00:00:15.349
IKARIS
I don't wear a cape.

00:00:20.414 --> 00:00:24.233
KRO
You can't protect any of them.

00:00:25.078 --> 00:00:26.195
THENA
Let's finish this.

